    "gate-lead": {
      "id": "gate-lead",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "A set passes the gate when each judge meets two limits on it. A brief's score is its mean over 3 draws, because a re-judge of the same image moves a cell by up to 1.3."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "gate-1": {
      "id": "gate-1",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {
        "ordered": false
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "**Mean**"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        "gate-1a"
      ]
    },
    "gate-1a": {
      "id": "gate-1a",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {
        "ordered": false
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The judge's mean in each category over the set's briefs is 9.5 or more."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "gate-2": {
      "id": "gate-2",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {
        "ordered": false
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "**Floor**"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        "gate-2a"
      ]
    },
    "gate-2a": {
      "id": "gate-2a",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {
        "ordered": false
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "No brief scores below 9 in any category. The flag "
        },
        {
          "insert": "--exempt-floor <brief>:<category>",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " removes one cell from the floor and keeps it in the mean."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "ceil": {
      "id": "ceil",
      "type": "callout",
      "props": {
        "title": "Opus caps complex diagrams at about 9",
        "tone": "warning"
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Opus gives a 9 for any category with one low finding, and it almost always writes one on a complex diagram. In 76 Opus judgings on 3 tuned briefs, craft and rhythm got no 10, while a 2-participant control scored 10 in 5 of 6 look categories. Measure a judge's ceiling on a known-good diagram before you set a 9.5 gate on it."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
